  'Ranking': '排行', 'Ranking metric': '排行依據', 'No ranked storms yet.': '尚無上榜的颱風。',
  'Deaths (estimated)': '死亡人數（估計）', 'Survival time': '存續時間', 'Grade': '等級', 'Merged': '已被吸收',
  'Clear ranking': '清除排行', 'Clear the saved ranking on this device?': '要清除此裝置上儲存的排行嗎？',
  'Ended storms from every world on this device. Active storms are listed until they end.': '此裝置上所有世界已結束的颱風。活動中的颱風會列出，直到結束為止。',
  'Development stages': '發展階段變化', 'Status': '狀態', 'Active': '活動中',
  'Extratropical transition': '溫帶氣旋轉化', 'No ended storms yet.': '尚無已結束的颱風。',
  'Set ocean warming, ENSO and polar temperature back to 0': '將海洋暖化、ENSO 與極地溫度重設為 0',
  'Shortcuts work from anywhere on the page, except while you type in a field or a dialog is open; with a button or tab focused, Space and Enter press it instead of playing or pausing.': '快速鍵在頁面任何位置都有效，但在輸入欄位中打字或對話方塊開啟時除外；焦點在按鈕或分頁上時，空白鍵與 Enter 鍵會按下該控制項，而不是播放或暫停。',
  'Movement speed measures travel, not wind. Gale radius estimates the area with winds of at least 17.2 m/s.': '移動速度指的是位移快慢，不是風速。暴風半徑是風速達 17.2 m/s 以上範圍的估計半徑。',
  'Select a record to show its full track and stage changes on the map. History belongs to this world; export a replay to keep it before resetting.': '選取一筆紀錄，即可在地圖上顯示完整路徑與階段變化。紀錄屬於目前的世界；重置前請先匯出重播檔案保存。',
  'Map grades: 0 Depression, 1 Tropical Storm, 2 Severe Tropical Storm, 3 Typhoon / Hurricane / Cyclone, 4 Very Strong, 5 Violent, then one more grade every 10 m/s above that.': '地圖等級：0 熱帶性低氣壓，1 熱帶風暴，2 強烈熱帶風暴，3 颱風／颶風／氣旋，4 強，5 超強，其後風速每增加 10 m/s 再升一級。',
  'Movement speed': '移動速度',
  'Merger': '合併',
  'Nearby storms in the same hemisphere affect each other’s movement: they can rotate around each other and draw closer. They merge within 100 km once both are at least 24 model hours old with winds of 17.2 m/s or more. The stronger storm keeps its ID and wind speed. Forming lows keep their own progress. Overlapping wind areas alone do not trigger a merger.': '同一半球相近的風暴會互相影響移動，可能彼此繞轉並逐漸靠近。當兩者都已生成至少 24 個模型小時、風速達 17.2 m/s 以上，且中心距離在 100 km 內時就會合併。較強的風暴保留編號與風速，醞釀中的低壓則維持各自的進度。僅僅風場重疊並不會觸發合併。',
  'Wind at centre': '中心風速',
  'Movement speed is the centre’s travel per model hour over the last step, excluding merger repositioning (0 at birth). Wind values are not movement speed. Centre wind can be weaker than the maximum wind around it.': '移動速度是上一步中心每個模型小時的位移量，不含合併造成的中心重新定位（剛生成時為 0）。風速並非移動速度。中心風速可能比周圍的最大風速弱。',
  'Canvas 2D map (WebGL unavailable). Fewer wind particles; the simulation is unaffected. Globe view needs WebGL; showing the flat map.': '目前使用 Canvas 2D 地圖（無法使用 WebGL）。風的粒子較少，但不影響模擬。地球儀檢視需要 WebGL，因此顯示平面地圖。',
