  'Low shear': '弱垂直風切', 'Strong shear': '強垂直風切',
  'Calms the upper winds so a storm can stay upright. Stacking is capped at −60 m/s.': '讓高層風力趨緩，使颱風能維持直立並發展。疊加效果上限為 −60 m/s。',
  'Adds upper-level wind that tilts and tears a storm apart. Stacking is capped at +60 m/s.': '增加高層風力，使颱風傾斜並被撕裂。疊加效果上限為 +60 m/s。',
