  'Cool': '冷海水', 'Dry': '乾燥空氣', 'Cold': '冷空氣', 'Sink': '下沉氣流',
  'Cools the ocean by up to 3 °C per placement, capped at 30 °C, and forms a weak high. Cuts the storm’s ocean energy supply. Ocean only.': '每次放置最多讓海表溫度降低 3 °C，疊加上限為 30 °C，並形成微弱的高壓，切斷颱風的海洋能量供應。僅能放置於海上。',
  'Reduces humidity and disrupts convection. Overlap with other weakening conditions to dissipate storms faster.': '降低濕度並破壞對流。與其他減弱條件重疊，可讓颱風更快消散。',
  'Cools lower-level air by up to 3 °C, capped at 18 °C. Suppresses growth and weakens storms.': '讓低層空氣最多降溫 3 °C，疊加上限為 18 °C，抑制發展並減弱颱風。',
  'Adds up to 1 m/s of descending air, capped at 9 m/s. Suppresses convection and weakens storms.': '最多增加 1 m/s 的下沉氣流，疊加上限為 9 m/s，抑制對流並減弱颱風。',
  'Cool water must be placed over the ocean.': '冷海水必須放置在海上。',
  'Warm air': '暖空氣', 'Updraft': '上升氣流', 'Air': '氣溫', 'Rise': '上升',
  'Warms lower-level air by up to 3 °C and supports convection. Stacking is capped at +18 °C. Does not warm the ocean.': '讓低層空氣最多升溫 3 °C，有助於對流。疊加效果上限為 +18 °C，不會讓海水升溫。',
  'Adds up to 1 m/s of rising air to help a moist disturbance organise and grow. Stacking is capped at 9 m/s. Still needs warm ocean, moisture and a low.': '最多增加 1 m/s 的上升氣流，協助潮濕的擾動組織化並發展。疊加上限為 9 m/s。仍需要暖海水、潮濕空氣與低壓。',
  'Warm': '暖水', 'Moist': '潮濕', 'Low': '低壓', 'High': '高壓',
