  // Map overlay row and tooltips
  'Moving streaks show surface wind speed and direction.': '流動的線條顯示地面風速與風向。',
  'Colours the wind streaks by moisture. Brighter is wetter.': '依濕度為風的流線上色，越亮代表越潮濕。',
  'Shades the areas where rain is falling.': '為正在下雨的區域上色。',
  'Draws isobars, lines of equal sea-level pressure.': '繪製等壓線，也就是海平面氣壓相同的連線。',
  'Tints the ocean by sea-surface temperature.': '依海表溫度為海面淡淡上色。',
  'Shows how many people live in each area.': '顯示各地區的居住人口。',
  'Recorded paths': '紀錄路徑', 'Draws the full dashed track of every loaded past typhoon.': '以虛線畫出每個已載入歷史颱風的完整路徑。',
  'City names': '城市名稱', 'Shows the names of cities and places. Their dots always stay.': '顯示城市與地名，圓點則一律保留。',
  'Isobar values': '等壓線數值', 'Shows the pressure number on each isobar.': '在每條等壓線上顯示氣壓數值。',
  'Sea names': '海洋名稱', 'Shows sea, lake and river names.': '顯示海、湖與河流的名稱。',
  'Changes the world, not just the view. When on, nature starts new storms every two to three days. Saved in your replay.': '這會改變世界本身，而不只是檢視方式。開啟後，大自然每兩到三天就會醞釀新的颱風，並記錄在你的重播中。',
  'Open the guide to the controls and conditions.': '開啟操作與天氣條件說明。',
