  // footer-privacy
  'Privacy policy': '隱私權政策', 'Buy me a coffee': '請我喝杯咖啡', 'Online leaderboard and privacy': '線上排行與隱私',
  'When a storm ends, your score (storm count, grade and estimated damage) is uploaded to the online leaderboard under an anonymous ID created on this device. The nickname shown there is chosen by you and is public, so do not use your real name. You can change it any time in the Ranking tab. Details are in the privacy policy linked below.': '颱風消散後，你的成績（颱風數量、等級與估計損失）會透過在此裝置上產生的匿名 ID 上傳到線上排行。排行上顯示的暱稱由你自己決定，且對所有人公開，請勿使用真實姓名。你可以隨時在「排行」分頁修改暱稱。詳情請見下方的隱私權政策連結。',
  'You can delete your nickname and all your uploaded results yourself: open the Ranking tab and press Delete my records. It takes effect immediately. If you no longer have the device, email us at the address in the privacy policy.': '你可以自行刪除暱稱和所有已上傳的成績：開啟「排行」分頁，按下「刪除我的紀錄」，立即生效。若你已不再擁有該裝置，請依隱私權政策中的地址寄信給我們。',
  'Choose a nickname in the Ranking tab to appear on the online leaderboard. Nicknames are public.': '在「排行」分頁設定暱稱，即可顯示在線上排行。暱稱是公開的。',
